8
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.480
When police chiefs and procurement
officers buy these machines, they

9
00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.400
rely on standard safety audits.

10
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.440
They watch the robot successfully navigate
a hallway and avoid

11
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:35.440
obstacles and follow basic verbal
commands, assuming that passing these

12
00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.440
