15
00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.360
In AI safety research, we consider those
claims to be

16
00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:51.040
marketing fluff. A real evaluation
requires a failure-first approach, assuming

17
00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:54.560
the system will be attacked and
documenting exactly how the

18
00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:57.360
