19
00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.840
This schematic maps out the actual
security reality of the

20
00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:04.360
Unitree robots currently walking American
streets.

21
00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:09.400
Independent researchers have identified
eight publicly disclosed critical vulnerabilities and

22
00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:12.120
exposures across the vendor's product
line.

23
00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:16.040
One of those flaws is a Bluetooth command
